Bloom's anchored overlay, select, typography, chip, aspect-ratio and checkbox
families (src/dropdown-menu/, src/context-menu/, src/menubar/, src/popover/,
src/floating/, src/select/, src/typography/, src/chip/, src/aspect-ratio/,
src/checkbox/, plus hooks/use-accessibility-focus.ts)
